  "description": "70's and teens meet to educate bad students?! Minseok was bullied by an Iljin in his middle school and chooses violence as a way to overcome this. Minseok, who has become a high school student, transfers to the worst school and meets the strongest old man called 'Justice' as a classmate. Not even dreaming that meeting the old man would change his whole fate, the strongest old man 'Justice' who wants to spend a pleasant school day, and 'Minseok school student who needs adult attention. A cider academy action movie in which students catch the difficulties and derailments of a teenager as a senior in life, and education to bad students!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98%EB%8A%94-%EC%A3%BD%EC%A7%80-%EC%95%8A%EB%8A%94%EB%8B%A4/2124)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/97521)",
